    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "fair enough. but isn't it true that the globalist free trade model has basically gutted middle class manufacturing in the west? if those policies actually protect local jobs and national security, aren't they technically \"efficient\" for the country even if the global market gets a bit shaky?",
